{{!
    @template format_aicourse/report_history_tab

    The "Chat History" tab of the per-course AI Tutor report.

    SECURITY: rows[].question, rows[].response and rows[].correction are raw student and AI
    generated text. They are rendered with a DOUBLE mustache, which is what escapes them. Changing
    any of them to a triple mustache would be a stored cross-site scripting hole, because a student
    can put arbitrary markup in a question.

    Classes required for JS (format_aicourse/report):
    * aicourse-chat-table on the results table — the module attaches its one delegated listener
      to it and does nothing at all when it is absent (the empty state renders no table).
    * aicourse-rating-btn, and its helpful / not-helpful state classes, which the module swaps
      in place after a successful rating rather than reloading the page.
    * aicourse-chat-response on the response cell — the module inserts or replaces the
      aicourse-chat-correction block inside it after a successful correction.
    * aicourse-correction-form on the disclosure panel, opened and closed with the HTML `hidden`
      attribute.
    * aicourse-row-updated is added to the <tr> the module has just written to and removed again
      on animationend; it is a state class only, never rendered by this template.

    Data attributes required for JS (format_aicourse/report, bootstrapped by
    format_aicourse\output\report\historytab::require_js()):
    * data-action="rate" with data-chatid and data-rating on the two rating buttons.
    * data-action="togglecorrection" with data-chatid and aria-controls on the disclosure buttons.
    * data-action="savecorrection" with data-chatid on the save button.
    * data-region="correctiontext" with data-chatid on the correction textarea.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * hasgroupsnotice bool True when the viewer is restricted to their own groups.
    * groupsnotice string PRE-ESCAPED markup from core's notification output component.
    * stats array Headline counters, each with value (string) and label (string).
    * filterform object The filter form.
      * action string Form action URL.
      * courseid int Course id, carried in a hidden field.
      * sort string Current sort key, carried in a hidden field.
      * dir string Current sort direction, carried in a hidden field.
      * perpage int Current rows per page, carried in a hidden field.
      * search string Current search text.
      * hasgroups bool True when the course has at least one group the viewer may filter by.
      * useroptions|groupoptions|ratingoptions array Each entry has value, label and selected.
      * reseturl string URL that clears every filter.
    * showingtext string "Showing x-y of z" summary.
    * perpageselect string PRE-ESCAPED markup from core's single_select output component.
    * tablecaption string Accessible name of the results table.
    * columns array Header cells, each with label, sortable, issorted, ariasort, isascending,
      isdescending, sorturl and sortlabel.
    * hasrows bool True when the current page has at least one row.
    * rows array One entry per chat record: id, avatar (PRE-ESCAPED core user_picture markup),
      hasavatar, fullname, question, response, hascorrection, correction, correctionshort, date,
      cancorrect (bool, true when the viewer holds format/aicourse:correctresponses; when false the
      correction controls are replaced by the read-only correction text),
      ishelpful, isnothelpful, canrate.
      the viewer did not write. Only reaches the page when a row has canrate false.
    * emptytitle string Heading of the empty state.
    * hasemptydesc bool True when the empty state has a body paragraph to show.
    * emptydesc string Body of the empty state.
    * pagingbar string PRE-ESCAPED markup from core's paging_bar output component.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "hasgroupsnotice": false,
        "groupsnotice": "",
        "stats": [
            {"value": "12", "label": "Total Questions"},
            {"value": "7", "label": "Marked Helpful"},
            {"value": "1", "label": "Corrected Responses"}
        ],
        "filterform": {
            "action": "https://example.org/course/format/aicourse/report.php",
            "courseid": 2,
            "sort": "timecreated",
            "dir": "DESC",
            "perpage": 20,
            "search": "",
            "hasgroups": true,
            "useroptions": [{"value": 0, "label": "All Students", "selected": true}],
            "groupoptions": [{"value": 0, "label": "All Groups", "selected": true}],
            "ratingoptions": [{"value": "", "label": "All Ratings", "selected": true}],
            "reseturl": "https://example.org/course/format/aicourse/report.php?id=2&tab=history"
        },
        "showingtext": "Showing 1-1 of 1 records",
        "perpageselect": "",
        "tablecaption": "AI Tutor questions and responses for this course",
        "columns": [
            {
                "label": "Student", "sortable": true, "issorted": false, "ariasort": "none",
                "isascending": false, "isdescending": false,
                "sorturl": "#student", "sortlabel": "Sort by Student"
            },
            {
                "label": "Question", "sortable": false, "issorted": false, "ariasort": "none",
                "isascending": false, "isdescending": false, "sorturl": "", "sortlabel": ""
            }
        ],
        "hasrows": true,
        "rows": [
            {
                "id": 5,
                "avatar": "",
                "hasavatar": false,
                "fullname": "Alice Adams",
                "question": "What is a light year?",
                "response": "A light year is the distance light travels in one year.",
                "hascorrection": false,
                "correction": "",
                "correctionshort": "",
                "date": "1/02/26, 09:14",
                "ishelpful": true,
                "isnothelpful": false,
                "canrate": true,
                "cancorrect": true
            }
        ],
        "emptytitle": "No chat history yet",
        "hasemptydesc": true,
        "emptydesc": "Students have not asked any questions yet.",
        "pagingbar": ""
    }
}}
{{#hasgroupsnotice}}{{{groupsnotice}}}{{/hasgroupsnotice}}

<div class="aicourse-stats-row">
    {{#stats}}
    <div class="aicourse-stat-card">
        <div class="aicourse-stat-value">{{value}}</div>
        <div class="aicourse-stat-label">{{label}}</div>
    </div>
    {{/stats}}
</div>

{{#filterform}}
<form method="get" action="{{action}}" class="aicourse-filter-form">
    <input type="hidden" name="id" value="{{courseid}}">
    <input type="hidden" name="tab" value="history">
    <input type="hidden" name="sort" value="{{sort}}">
    <input type="hidden" name="dir" value="{{dir}}">
    <input type="hidden" name="perpage" value="{{perpage}}">
    <fieldset class="aicourse-filters">
        <legend class="sr-only">{{#str}} filter {{/str}}</legend>

        <label class="sr-only" for="aicourse-filteruser">{{#str}} aireport_student, format_aicourse {{/str}}</label>
        <select id="aicourse-filteruser" name="filteruser" class="aicourse-filter-select">
            {{#useroptions}}
            <option value="{{value}}"{{#selected}} selected{{/selected}}>{{label}}</option>
            {{/useroptions}}
        </select>

        {{#hasgroups}}
        <label class="sr-only" for="aicourse-filtergroup">{{#str}} aireport_all_groups, format_aicourse {{/str}}</label>
        <select id="aicourse-filtergroup" name="filtergroup" class="aicourse-filter-select">
            {{#groupoptions}}
            <option value="{{value}}"{{#selected}} selected{{/selected}}>{{label}}</option>
            {{/groupoptions}}
        </select>
        {{/hasgroups}}

        <label class="sr-only" for="aicourse-filterrating">{{#str}} aireport_rating, format_aicourse {{/str}}</label>
        <select id="aicourse-filterrating" name="filterrating" class="aicourse-filter-select">
            {{#ratingoptions}}
            <option value="{{value}}"{{#selected}} selected{{/selected}}>{{label}}</option>
            {{/ratingoptions}}
        </select>

        <label class="sr-only" for="aicourse-search">{{#str}} aireport_search, format_aicourse {{/str}}</label>
        <input id="aicourse-search" type="search" name="search" class="aicourse-filter-input"
            placeholder="{{#str}} aireport_search, format_aicourse {{/str}}" value="{{search}}">

        <button type="submit" class="aicourse-correction-btn btn btn-primary">
            {{#str}} aireport_apply, format_aicourse {{/str}}
        </button>
        <a href="{{reseturl}}" class="aicourse-correction-btn btn btn-secondary">
            {{#str}} admin_report_reset, format_aicourse {{/str}}
        </a>
    </fieldset>
</form>
{{/filterform}}

<div class="aicourse-report-toolbar">
    <p class="aicourse-report-count">{{showingtext}}</p>
    <div class="aicourse-report-perpage">{{{perpageselect}}}</div>
</div>

{{#hasrows}}
<table class="aicourse-chat-table">
    <caption>{{tablecaption}}</caption>
    <thead>
        <tr>
            {{#columns}}
            <th scope="col" aria-sort="{{ariasort}}">
                {{#sortable}}
                <a href="{{sorturl}}" class="aicourse-sort-link" aria-label="{{sortlabel}}">
                    <span>{{label}}</span>
                    {{#isascending}}<span aria-hidden="true">&#9650;</span>{{/isascending}}
                    {{#isdescending}}<span aria-hidden="true">&#9660;</span>{{/isdescending}}
                </a>
                {{/sortable}}
                {{^sortable}}{{label}}{{/sortable}}
            </th>
            {{/columns}}
        </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
        {{#rows}}
        <tr>
            <td>
                <div class="aicourse-chat-user">
                    {{#hasavatar}}{{{avatar}}}{{/hasavatar}}
                    <span class="aicourse-chat-username">{{fullname}}</span>
                </div>
            </td>
            <td class="aicourse-chat-question">{{question}}</td>
            <td class="aicourse-chat-response">
                <div>{{response}}</div>
                {{#hascorrection}}
                <div class="aicourse-chat-correction">
                    <strong>{{#str}} aireport_correction, format_aicourse {{/str}}</strong>
                    <div>{{correctionshort}}</div>
                </div>
                {{/hascorrection}}
            </td>
            <td class="aicourse-chat-date">{{date}}</td>
            <td>
                {{#canrate}}
                <div class="aicourse-chat-rating" role="group"
                    aria-label="{{#str}} aireport_rating, format_aicourse {{/str}}">
                    <button type="button" class="aicourse-rating-btn{{#ishelpful}} helpful{{/ishelpful}}"
                        data-action="rate" data-chatid="{{id}}" data-rating="1"
                        aria-label="{{#str}} aireport_filter_helpful, format_aicourse {{/str}}"
                        aria-pressed="{{#ishelpful}}true{{/ishelpful}}{{^ishelpful}}false{{/ishelpful}}">
                        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                            fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
                            <path d="M14 9V5a3 3 0 0 0-3-3l-4 9v11h11.28a2 2 0 0 0 2-1.7l1.38-9a2 2 0 0 0-2-2.3zM7 22H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-7a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h3"/>
                        </svg>
                    </button>
                    <button type="button" class="aicourse-rating-btn{{#isnothelpful}} not-helpful{{/isnothelpful}}"
                        data-action="rate" data-chatid="{{id}}" data-rating="-1"
                        aria-label="{{#str}} aireport_filter_nothelpful, format_aicourse {{/str}}"
                        aria-pressed="{{#isnothelpful}}true{{/isnothelpful}}{{^isnothelpful}}false{{/isnothelpful}}">
                        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                            fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
                            <path d="M10 15v4a3 3 0 0 0 3 3l4-9V2H5.72a2 2 0 0 0-2 1.7l-1.38 9a2 2 0 0 0 2 2.3zm7-13h2.67A2.31 2.31 0 0 1 22 4v7a2.31 2.31 0 0 1-2.33 2H17"/>
                        </svg>
                    </button>
                </div>
                {{/canrate}}
                {{^canrate}}{{!
                    ACF-FIX-2.1: on the teacher report almost every row belongs to a learner. The
                    rating is the LEARNER's judgement of the AI answer and is the signal this report
                    exists to surface, so a teacher must not be able to overwrite it. It is shown
                    read-only here. Teachers give their own feedback through the Correct action,
                    which is scoped by capability rather than by row ownership.
                }}
                <span class="aicourse-chat-rating aicourse-chat-rating-readonly">
                    <span class="aicourse-rating-state{{#ishelpful}} helpful{{/ishelpful}}{{#isnothelpful}} not-helpful{{/isnothelpful}}">
                        {{#ishelpful}}{{#str}} aireport_rating_learner_helpful, format_aicourse {{/str}}{{/ishelpful}}
                        {{#isnothelpful}}{{#str}} aireport_rating_learner_nothelpful, format_aicourse {{/str}}{{/isnothelpful}}
                        {{^ishelpful}}{{^isnothelpful}}{{#str}} aireport_rating_learner_none, format_aicourse {{/str}}{{/isnothelpful}}{{/ishelpful}}
                    </span>
                </span>
                {{/canrate}}
            </td>
            <td>
                {{#cancorrect}}
                <button type="button" class="aicourse-correction-btn" data-action="togglecorrection"
                    data-chatid="{{id}}" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="aicourse-correction-{{id}}">
                    {{#str}} aireport_correct, format_aicourse {{/str}}
                </button>
                <div class="aicourse-correction-form" id="aicourse-correction-{{id}}" hidden>
                    <label for="aicourse-correction-text-{{id}}">
                        {{#str}} aireport_correction, format_aicourse {{/str}}
                    </label>
                    <textarea class="aicourse-correction-textarea" id="aicourse-correction-text-{{id}}"
                        data-region="correctiontext" data-chatid="{{id}}"
                        placeholder="{{#str}} aireport_correction_placeholder, format_aicourse {{/str}}">{{correction}}</textarea>
                    <div class="aicourse-correction-actions">
                        <button type="button" class="aicourse-correction-btn btn btn-primary"
                            data-action="savecorrection" data-chatid="{{id}}">
                            {{#str}} aireport_save, format_aicourse {{/str}}
                        </button>
                        <button type="button" class="aicourse-correction-btn btn btn-secondary"
                            data-action="togglecorrection" data-chatid="{{id}}"
                            aria-controls="aicourse-correction-{{id}}">
                            {{#str}} aireport_cancel, format_aicourse {{/str}}
                        </button>
                    </div>
                </div>
                {{/cancorrect}}
                {{^cancorrect}}
                {{#hascorrection}}<span class="aicourse-chat-correction">{{correctionshort}}</span>{{/hascorrection}}
                {{/cancorrect}}
            </td>
        </tr>
        {{/rows}}
    </tbody>
</table>
<div class="aicourse-pagination">{{{pagingbar}}}</div>
{{/hasrows}}
{{^hasrows}}
<div class="aicourse-empty-state">
    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="64" height="64" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"
        stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
        <path d="M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z"/>
    </svg>
    <h3 class="h5">{{emptytitle}}</h3>
    {{#hasemptydesc}}<p>{{emptydesc}}</p>{{/hasemptydesc}}
</div>
{{/hasrows}}
